---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Free Forex Seminars | BlueFx Markets" description="Free forex seminars in Windhoek, Walvis Bay and online from the BlueFx Markets desk." page="seminars">
<main id="content">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Tools / Free Forex Seminars</p>
      <h1>Free forex seminars</h1>
      <p class="lede">Short sessions for Namibian traders. No fee, no deposit required, and nothing on the calendar is a live trading recommendation.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container two">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">This season</p>
        <h2>Three seats, all free</h2>
        <p>The desk hosts the seminars at Maerua Mall Office Tower in Windhoek, one Saturday in Walvis Bay, and one hour online. Times are Central Africa Time. Bring a notebook. The examples use NAD pairs, gold and a synthetic index.</p>
        <div class="event-list" style="margin-top:18px">
          <article class="event">
            <time datetime="2026-11-27T18:00">Thu 27 Nov<br>18:00 CAT</time>
            <div>
              <strong>Reading a NAD chart</strong>
              <p>Unit 4, Maerua Mall Office Tower, Windhoek. EUR/NAD, USD/NAD and what a pip is worth in Namibian Dollars.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="event">
            <time datetime="2026-12-06T09:30">Sat 6 Dec<br>09:30 CAT</time>
            <div>
              <strong>Gold and the Namibian Dollar</strong>
              <p>Walvis Bay waterfront meeting room. XAU/NAD, session times, and why a gold move is not the same as a rand move.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="event">
            <time datetime="2026-12-16T18:00">Tue 16 Dec<br>18:00 CAT</time>
            <div>
              <strong>Risk before the first lot</strong>
              <p>Online. Stop-outs, the 1:2000 warning on Premium, and how a free seminar is not a signal to trade.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Reserve</p>
        <h2>Hold a demo seat</h2>
        <p>The form stays in this browser. BlueFx does not receive the name or the email.</p>
        <form class="panel" id="seat-form">
          <label class="field"><span>Name</span><input name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required></label>
          <label class="field"><span>Email</span><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></label>
          <label class="field"><span>Seminar</span>
            <select name="seminar">
              <option>27 Nov — Reading a NAD chart, Windhoek</option>
              <option>6 Dec — Gold and the Namibian Dollar, Walvis Bay</option>
              <option>16 Dec — Risk before the first lot, online</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <button class="btn btn-red" type="submit">Reserve a free seat</button>
          <output id="seat-msg" style="display:block;font-weight:700;margin-top:12px"></output>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section band">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Also free</p>
      <h2>Classes and signal robots sit beside the seminars.</h2>
      <p>The Tuesday class is four weeks. The robots only post sample alerts.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-red" href="/classes">Free forex classes</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/robots">Free signal robots</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script is:inline>
    document.getElementById("seat-form").addEventListener("submit", (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      const form = event.currentTarget;
      const name = form.name.value.trim();
      const out = document.getElementById("seat-msg");
      out.textContent = name + ", the seat is noted on this demo only. Nothing was sent to BlueFx.";
      form.reset();
    });
  </script>
</main>
</Base>
